      "v": 19,
      "zh": "我要显神迹（或译：记号）在他们中间。逃脱的，我要差到列国去，就是到他施、普勒、拉弓的路德和土巴、雅完，并素来没有听见我名声、没有看见我荣耀辽远的海岛；他们必将我的荣耀传扬在列国中。",
      "en": "I will perform a mighty act among them[NOTE:1] and then send some of those who remain to the nations—to Tarshish, Pul,[NOTE:2] Lud[NOTE:3] (known for its archers[NOTE:4]), Tubal, Javan,[NOTE:5] and to the distant coastlands[NOTE:6] that have not heard about me or seen my splendor. They will tell the nations of my splendor.",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “and I will set a sign among them.” The precise meaning of this statement is unclear. Elsewhere “to set a sign” means “perform a mighty act” (Ps 78:43; Jer 32:20), “make [someone] an object lesson” (Ezek 14:8), and “erect a [literal] standard” (Ps 74:4).",
        "Some prefer to read “Put” (i.e., Libya).",
        "That is, Lydia (in Asia Minor).",
        "Heb “drawers of the bow” (KJV and ASV both similar).",
        "Javan is generally identified today as Greece (so NIV, NCV, NLT).",
        "Or “islands” (NIV)."
      ],
